# Smart Format (optional): calls a local Ollama instance to restructure
# messy pasted text into clean Markdown before conversion. Only works when
# Morphly itself is running locally: a deployed instance (e.g. on Vercel)
# has no network path to a machine's localhost Ollama, so Smart Format will
# just fail with a clear error there. Everything else in the app works
# without this; it's purely additive.

# Base URL of your local Ollama server.
# OLLAMA_HOST=http://127.0.0.1:11434

# Any model you've already pulled locally (`ollama pull <model>`).
# OLLAMA_MODEL=llama3.1
